# Trivy vulnerability ignore file — Hearth (HEA-1528)
#
# Policy: CVEs listed here affect the docs-site Docusaurus build toolchain
# only. The docs-site is a static documentation site deployed to GitHub Pages
# (see .github/workflows/docs-site.yml). Its npm dependencies are never part
# of the Hearth server binary, any client SDK, or any production artifact.
# The Hearth runtime surface (Rust binary + SDKs) is scanned and must remain
# clean — suppressions here are strictly limited to build-tooling CVEs.
#
# Review: revisit each entry when a patched version of the affected package
# is available in the Docusaurus dependency graph.

# CVE-2026-55602: docs-site transitive npm dep (Docusaurus build tooling only).
# Not present in the Hearth binary or any shipped SDK artifact.
CVE-2026-55602

# CVE-2026-53550: docs-site transitive npm dep (Docusaurus build tooling only).
# Two instances (different transitive paths); both are build-time only.
CVE-2026-53550

# CVE-2026-48038: docs-site transitive npm dep (Docusaurus build tooling only).
# Not present in the Hearth binary or any shipped SDK artifact.
CVE-2026-48038
